WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.660
The kids went up to the attic.

2
00:00:07.661 --> 00:00:12.011
It was very dark and dusty.

3
00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:19.623
They saw things to play with.

4
00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:25.042
"Old books!" Emmy said.

5
00:00:25.043 --> 00:00:28.118
"Old toys!" Harry said.

6
00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:30.999
Oliver looked around.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.519
"There's a ghost in the corner!" he said.

8
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:44.828
"There's no such thing as ghosts," Harry said.

9
00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:49.002
"You imagined it," Emmy said.

10
00:00:49.003 --> 00:00:56.655
Thump! "I did not imagine it!" Oliver said.

11
00:00:56.656 --> 00:01:02.005
"It was just the wind," Harry said.

12
00:01:02.006 --> 00:01:06.085
"Let's get some flashlights," Emmy said.

13
00:01:06.086 --> 00:01:10.619
The kids went back to the attic with flashlights.

14
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:18.830
Harry walked toward the old toys.

15
00:01:18.831 --> 00:01:27.424
He gasped. "One is missing!"

16
00:01:27.425 --> 00:01:38.611
Thump! "That was not the wind!" Oliver said.

17
00:01:38.612 --> 00:01:41.977
Emmy looked at the old books.

18
00:01:41.978 --> 00:01:50.656
"A book is missing too!" she said.

19
00:01:50.657 --> 00:01:56.007
"This attic is haunted!" Oliver said.

20
00:01:56.008 --> 00:02:00.434
Emmy shined her flashlight.

21
00:02:00.435 --> 00:02:05.146
"I see some hair," she said.

22
00:02:05.147 --> 00:02:09.300
"Ghosts don't have hair."

23
00:02:09.301 --> 00:02:12.575
Harry shined his flashlight.

24
00:02:12.576 --> 00:02:17.422
"I see paw prints in the dust!

25
00:02:17.423 --> 00:02:20.862
Ghosts don't have paws."

26
00:02:20.863 --> 00:02:24.071
Oliver took a deep breath.

27
00:02:24.072 --> 00:02:27.227
He stepped toward the corner.

28
00:02:27.228 --> 00:02:30.482
Something was there.

29
00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:36.148
It was . . .

30
00:02:36.149 --> 00:02:40.555
"Rover!" Oliver cried.

31
00:02:40.556 --> 00:02:43.409
Rover was chewing on the toy.

32
00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.180
The book lay nearby.

33
00:02:46.181 --> 00:02:52.613
The kids laughed.

34
00:02:52.614 --> 00:02:57.308
"Rover followed us up here," said Emmy.

35
00:02:57.309 --> 00:03:00.594
Oliver patted the dog.

36
00:03:00.595 --> 00:03:11.558
"Rover likes the attic too!"

